 "provenance": "Bavaria 13 (secret stage, world 1 level 12): secret exit 10,3 from the spawn, control-only on the exact S700 core (paint-every-frame harness), 3118 ticks, no damage, no deaths, no resets. Start values: weaponTier 2 (hook from the Bavaria 3 chest 24,25; the route hooks a mine, the crawler twice and the last diamond), maxHealth 4 (no armor), lives 12 (campaign value used by the other Bavaria routes), diamonds/redDiamonds 0 (per-stage HUD; the stage's own 10 diamonds open the magic lock 7,3), diving true (diving item from the Bavaria 8 riddle chest 20,12; Bavaria 13 follows Bavaria 12 on the world map, which is unlocked by the Bavaria 7 secret exit, so this assumes it is played after Bavaria 8 or revisited, as for Bavaria 12; the route swims in the flooded pit to push the mine to 10,49 and in the diamond room to collect 9,37 and 8,37). Route: walk-in, hook the base stone and open the brick shaft, checkpoint #1 7,47 (demo 19). Hammer the pool grass 14,46, hook mine 7,45 into the stream so it floats into the pit, push it to 10,49 by swimming, hit switch 17,52 three times (the pit drains, stone 18,55 floats up), out via grass 19,55, column 20 and bridge 14,49, hook mine 10,50 from 13,50 so it falls and blows both rubbles 12-13,53; silver key from chest 13,57; open silver lock 7,42 (gate 7,43), hit switch 7,39, checkpoint #2 12,31. Cut grass 5,35 to drain the diamond room, push a stone, cut grass 13,35, hit switch 14,37 (east bridges open; 5 diamonds). Back through 13,35: diamond 7,36 from above, push stone 8,35 left, diamonds 9,36 9,37 8,37 (9 diamonds). East over bridges 15,36/17,36 and up columns 20/19 avoiding both spike traps (wait at 20,33 until the slow spike 20,30 is retracted and the fast one allows entry). Checkpoint #3 16,27, riddle trigger 17,27 (LIGHT THE TORCH): hook the crawler from 8,26 so it moves onto the middle block, then from 12,26 so it climbs over the torch 13,26 (the hero is invulnerable while hooking); the gates open, leave via 18,24 and column 20 to checkpoint #4 16,9. Walk through the grass 18,9 and 19,9 (the four stones rest on the hero), hook the last diamond 21,9 into the hero from 19,9 (10 diamonds, the magic lock opens), push the fallen stone 18,9 left to 15,9 and step out to 16,9; walk to the secret exit 10,3.",
